\subparagraph{UC-15.1 Upload Identity Documents}

\begin{longtable}{|L{3.2cm}|L{4.1cm}|L{2.7cm}|L{4.1cm}|}
\hline
UC ID and Name & \multicolumn{3}{l|}{UC-15.1 Upload Identity Documents} \\ \hline
Created By: & Nguyen Lu Nhat Huy & Date Created: & 14/09/2026 \\ \hline
Primary Actor: & Freelancer & Secondary Actors: & N/A \\ \hline
Trigger: & \multicolumn{3}{L{11.1cm}|}{When an authenticated freelancer submits identity documents for verification.} \\ \hline
Description: & \multicolumn{3}{L{11.1cm}|}{Allows a freelancer to upload identity verification documents (ID card, passport, driver's license) for platform identity verification.} \\ \hline
Preconditions: & \multicolumn{3}{L{11.1cm}|}{
\textbf{PRE-1} The freelancer is authenticated and logged into the system. \newline
\textbf{PRE-2} The freelancer has not already submitted an active verification request.
} \\ \hline
Post-conditions: & \multicolumn{3}{L{11.1cm}|}{
\textbf{POST-1} An identity verification record is created with status PENDING. \newline
\textbf{POST-2} The verification request is submitted to the admin moderation queue.
} \\ \hline
Normal Flow: & \multicolumn{3}{L{11.1cm}|}{
\textbf{A. Upload Identity Documents} \newline
1. Freelancer navigates to the Identity Verification section in profile settings. \newline
2. Freelancer selects the document type (National ID, Passport, Driver's License). \newline
3. Freelancer uploads front and back document images or files. \newline
4. Freelancer clicks the ``Submit Verification'' button. \newline
5. The system validates file format, size (under 5MB), and required fields. \newline
6. The system securely uploads document files to storage. \newline
7. The system creates a new record in \texttt{id\_verification\_documents} with status PENDING. \newline
8. The system displays the message ``Identity documents submitted successfully.''
} \\ \hline
Alternative Flows: & \multicolumn{3}{L{11.1cm}|}{
\textbf{A.1 Cancel Upload} \newline
1. Freelancer clicks ``Cancel'' during file upload. \newline
2. The system discards unsubmitted files and returns to profile settings.
} \\ \hline
Exceptions: & \multicolumn{3}{L{11.1cm}|}{
\textbf{EX-01: Invalid Document File} \newline
1. The system detects unsupported format or file size exceeding 5MB. \newline
2. The system displays ``Invalid file format or size exceeds limit (5MB max).'' \newline
3. The use case ends. \newline
\textbf{EX-02: Already Verified} \newline
1. The freelancer's identity is already verified (status APPROVED). \newline
2. The system displays ``Your identity is already verified.'' \newline
3. The use case ends.
} \\ \hline
Priority: & \multicolumn{3}{L{11.1cm}|}{High} \\ \hline
Frequency of Use: & \multicolumn{3}{L{11.1cm}|}{Low} \\ \hline
Business Rules: & \multicolumn{3}{L{11.1cm}|}{
BR-ID-01: Document files must be image (JPEG/PNG/WebP) or PDF format and less than 5MB. \newline
BR-ID-02: Each freelancer can have only one active PENDING or APPROVED verification request.
} \\ \hline
Other Information: & \multicolumn{3}{L{11.1cm}|}{Uploaded identity documents are accessible only by administrators for privacy compliance.} \\ \hline
Assumptions: & \multicolumn{3}{L{11.1cm}|}{Cloud storage is available and securely configured.} \\ \hline
\end{longtable}

